entityDescription:
Non-profit association for public benefit aimed at regional, national, and transnational development, with a focus on thematic areas according to strategic documents. The priority areas for the development of the association are:
- Science, innovation, and modern technologies &ndash; creative and recreational industries;
- Investment in human resources;
- Low-carbon economy, green investments, circular economy; integrated development of urban, rural, and coastal areas;
- Cross-border and trans-regional development;
- Tourism and wellness;
- Chemical products and technologies.
7. &middot; Information and communication technologies, services, and telecommunications;
8. &middot; Marine ecology, aquaculture, and fish farming;
9. &middot; Biotechnology, bio-foods, and bio-products;
10. &middot; Mechatronics, energy technologies, and biofuels;
11. &middot; Humanities and social sciences;
12. &middot; Medicine, public health, and healthcare.
Тo achieve its set goals, the association prepares and conducts research, studies, and analyses related to scientific and socio-economic development. It creates, coordinates, manages, and monitors projects and programs, and provides consultation and support to other public and private organizations in relation to the preparation of analyses, scientific research, and the development and implementation of projects.

